# When the coupler transmission equals the round-trip amplitude (kappa = 0.01436) the resonance goes to zero.

title All-pass ring at critical coupling
medium lambda0=1.55 neff=2.4 ng=4.2 loss_db_cm=5
sweep 1.54 1.56 16001

comp c coupler kappa=0.01436341643
comp w waveguide length=125.6637061436
link c.4 w.1
link w.2 c.2
port in c.1
port through c.3

expect passive
expect deeper through -30
expect fsr through dips 4.55202 0.005
